- qjs-debugger.js: header comment says "Modes: repl (default, implemented), server, gui (stubs)"
  but both server and gui modes are fully implemented (see README's mode table and
  gui/PLAN.md phases 1-5, all landed). The comment is stale and should be updated.

- imgui/: still contains debugger-client.js, imgui-debugger.js, poc.js, source-view.js,
  target.js, transport.js, var-tree.js, wire-codec.js even though commit 53c6812 removed
  the classes already implemented in the top-level *.js files. Per gui/PLAN.md, imgui/ is
  "not used or touched" by the supported GUI (gui/), so it's unclear which of these
  remaining files are still needed vs. leftover from the earlier prototype.
- repl-run-debuggee-sigsegv: after fixing the missing global os, running "r" in the
  repl with plain qjs as debuggee makes the spawned qjs die with SIGSEGV
  (qjs examples/orbit.js alone runs fine). found while fixing the 'os' module
  required error; cause not investigated.

    qjsm qjs-debugger.js --args examples/orbit.js   # then: r

